  "text": "Checked against an independent record: in the 1,796 tracts AVs drove, the map ranks 324 DMV-reported autonomous-mode collisions (2019\u201324) per km of road within county at Spearman 0.45 (the road-length version it replaces: 0.04; crossing density alone: 0.47). At the 500 m cells it predicts, the riskiest tenth holds 56% of the crashes on 13% of the road km. No collision data were used to build it. Against 366k police-reported crashes (2022\u201324), 7 of the 10 specialised layers raise the share of their own kind of crash (not: junctions, shops & services (curbside), freeway ramps)."
